# Per-Dockerfile build-context filter for the commit image (BuildKit uses
# `<dockerfile-path>.dockerignore` — this file — IN PLACE OF the repo-root
# `.dockerignore` when building with `-f mayhem/Dockerfile`).
#
# Upstream nxdk ships a root `.dockerignore` that excludes `**/.git` (for its
# own image). Our spec REQUIRES baking the FULL repo incl. `.git` history into
# the commit image (the grader/PATCH tier uses it — SPEC §6.2 item 2), so we
# override that here WITHOUT touching the upstream-tracked file (keeps the
# mayhem layer a clean additive replay).
#
# Keep .git and source; drop only local build artifacts and editor/OS cruft.

# ── Build outputs / local cruft ──────────────────────────────────────────────
mayhem-build/
mayhem-tests/
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
**/__pycache__/

# ── Editor / OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
